WEBVTT

54:34.271 --> 54:37.274
It's him! He's after Akihiko!

55:04.009 --> 55:06.178
Why are you doing this?

55:07.805 --> 55:09.473
We never did anything to you!

55:09.890 --> 55:11.099
You survived...

55:11.391 --> 55:13.227
Half the planet didn't.

55:13.727 --> 55:15.145
They got Thanos.

55:15.729 --> 55:16.730
You get me...

55:21.985 --> 55:24.029
You're done hurting people.

55:25.113 --> 55:27.199
WE hurt people?

55:30.786 --> 55:31.662
You're crazy!

56:01.942 --> 56:02.943
Wait! Help me!

56:04.361 --> 56:05.904
I'll give you anything!

56:07.155 --> 56:08.282
What do you want?
